# "Island" in Lord of Atlantis's "have islandwalk" is a basic land type word (CR 612.2; Mind Bend's own example changes
# "forestwalk" to "islandwalk"). Lord of Atlantis gives Bot1's Hullbreacher, a Merfolk, +1/+1 and islandwalk: Bot2 controls an
# Island, so Bot2's Ornithopter can't block it (CR 702.14c), though it could block the Lord, which attacks beside it (the
# Lord's "other" leaves itself out). Then Mind Bend replaces Island with Swamp in the Lord's text: the Hullbreacher has
# swampwalk instead (layer 3, then layer 6), Bot2 controls no Swamp, and the Ornithopter blocks it and dies. Merfolk is a
# creature type, not a word Mind Bend can change (it offers color words and basic land types only).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lord of Atlantis
Hullbreacher
Mind Bend
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lord of Atlantis.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hullbreacher.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Keywords = Flash; Islandwalk
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Power = 4
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lord of Atlantis; Hullbreacher > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Hullbreacher)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mind Bend.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Lord of Atlantis)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a basic land type)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Keywords = Flash; Swampwalk
Bot1.Attack(Hullbreacher > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Hullbreacher)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Keywords = Flash; Swampwalk
Bot1.Battlefield.Hullbreacher.Power = 4
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Life = 14
